stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Installing: register
    Installing --> Installed: install event done
    Installing --> Redundant: install failed
    Installed --> Activating: no old worker in control or skipWaiting
    Installed --> Waiting: old worker still controls pages
    Waiting --> Activating: old tabs closed
    Activating --> Activated: activate event done
    Activated --> Redundant: replaced by newer version
    Redundant --> [*]
